# OpenUG2 UG2 career metadata overrides (UTF-8/ASCII)
# Rename to career.cfg and keep in ports/openug2/mods/ to enable.
# Get the exact case-sensitive event names from:
#   ./build/ug2_career_dump /path/to/GLOBAL/GlobalB.lzc
# Syntax: cash EXACT_ORIGINAL_EVENT_ID 0..10000000
# Example (disabled until you remove '#'):
# cash S3_SPRINT_6 2000
#
# This release PREVIEWS the modified catalog and logs it at game startup.
# Real race payout currently stays in prototype mode until event mapping
# and verified race completion are connected; mods are NOT live payouts yet.
